{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Query comes with its own ESLint plugin. This plugin is used to enforce best practices and to help you avoid common mistakes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The plugin is a separate package that you need to install:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm i -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or"}]},{"type":"code","value":"yarn add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or"}]},{"type":"code","value":"bun add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"flat-config-eslint-config-js","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Flat Config ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"eslint.config.js"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"recommended-setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Recommended setup"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To enable all of the recommended rules for our plugin, add the following config:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import pluginQuery from '@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query'\n\nexport default [\n  ...pluginQuery.configs['flat/recommended'],\n  // Any other config...\n]","lang":"js"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"recommended-strict-setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Recommended strict setup"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"flat/recommended-strict"},{"type":"text","value":" config extends "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"flat/recommended"},{"type":"text","value":" with additional opinionated rules that enforce best practices more aggressively."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import pluginQuery from '@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query'\n\nexport default [\n  ...pluginQuery.configs['flat/recommended-strict'],\n  // Any other config...\n]","lang":"js"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"custom-setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Custom setup"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Alternatively, you can load the plugin and configure only the rules you want to use:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import pluginQuery from '@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query'\n\nexport default [\n  {\n    plugins: {\n      '@tanstack/query': pluginQuery,\n    },\n    rules: {\n      '@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps': 'error',\n    },\n  },\n  // Any other config...\n]","lang":"js"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"legacy-config-eslintrc","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Legacy Config ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".eslintrc"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"recommended-setup-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Recommended setup"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To enable all of the recommended rules for our plugin, add "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"plugin:@tanstack/query/recommended"},{"type":"text","value":" in extends:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"extends\": [\"plugin:@tanstack/query/recommended\"]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"recommended-strict-setup-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Recommended strict setup"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"recommendedStrict"},{"type":"text","value":" config extends "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"recommended"},{"type":"text","value":" with additional opinionated rules:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"extends\": [\"plugin:@tanstack/query/recommendedStrict\"]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"custom-setup-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Custom setup"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Alternatively, add "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/query"},{"type":"text","value":" to the plugins section, and configure the rules you want to use:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"plugins\": [\"@tanstack/query\"],\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps\": \"error\"\n  }\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"rules","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rules"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./exhaustive-deps.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./no-rest-destructuring.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/query/no-rest-destructuring"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./stable-query-client.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/query/stable-query-client"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./no-unstable-deps.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/query/no-unstable-deps"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./infinite-query-property-order.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/query/infinite-query-property-order"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./no-void-query-fn.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/query/no-void-query-fn"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./mutation-property-order.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/query/mutation-property-order"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./prefer-query-options.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/query/prefer-query-options"}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"flat-config-eslint-config-js","text":"Flat Config (eslint.config.js)","level":2},{"id":"recommended-setup","text":"Recommended setup","level":3},{"id":"recommended-strict-setup","text":"Recommended strict setup","level":3},{"id":"custom-setup","text":"Custom setup","level":3},{"id":"legacy-config-eslintrc","text":"Legacy Config (.eslintrc)","level":2},{"id":"recommended-setup-2","text":"Recommended setup","level":3},{"id":"recommended-strict-setup-2","text":"Recommended strict setup","level":3},{"id":"custom-setup-2","text":"Custom setup","level":3},{"id":"rules","text":"Rules","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack Query comes with its own ESLint plugin. This plugin is used to enforce best practices and to help you avoid common mistakes.\n\n## Installation\n\nThe plugin is a separate package that you need to install:\n\n```bash\nnpm i -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\npnpm add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nyarn add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nbun add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query\n```\n\n## Flat Config (`eslint.config.js`)\n\n### Recommended setup\n\nTo enable all of the recommended rules for our plugin, add the following config:\n\n```js\nimport pluginQuery from '@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query'\n\nexport default [\n  ...pluginQuery.configs['flat/recommended'],\n  // Any other config...\n]\n```\n\n### Recommended strict setup\n\nThe `flat/recommended-strict` config extends `flat/recommended` with additional opinionated rules that enforce best practices more aggressively.\n\n```js\nimport pluginQuery from '@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query'\n\nexport default [\n  ...pluginQuery.configs['flat/recommended-strict'],\n  // Any other config...\n]\n```\n\n### Custom setup\n\nAlternatively, you can load the plugin and configure only the rules you want to use:\n\n```js\nimport pluginQuery from '@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query'\n\nexport default [\n  {\n    plugins: {\n      '@tanstack/query': pluginQuery,\n    },\n    rules: {\n      '@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps': 'error',\n    },\n  },\n  // Any other config...\n]\n```\n\n## Legacy Config (`.eslintrc`)\n\n### Recommended setup\n\nTo enable all of the recommended rules for our plugin, add `plugin:@tanstack/query/recommended` in extends:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"extends\": [\"plugin:@tanstack/query/recommended\"]\n}\n```\n\n### Recommended strict setup\n\nThe `recommendedStrict` config extends `recommended` with additional opinionated rules:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"extends\": [\"plugin:@tanstack/query/recommendedStrict\"]\n}\n```\n\n### Custom setup\n\nAlternatively, add `@tanstack/query` to the plugins section, and configure the rules you want to use:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plugins\": [\"@tanstack/query\"],\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps\": \"error\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Rules\n\n- [@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps](./exhaustive-deps.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/no-rest-destructuring](./no-rest-destructuring.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/stable-query-client](./stable-query-client.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/no-unstable-deps](./no-unstable-deps.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/infinite-query-property-order](./infinite-query-property-order.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/no-void-query-fn](./no-void-query-fn.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/mutation-property-order](./mutation-property-order.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/prefer-query-options](./prefer-query-options.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: eslint-plugin-query\ntitle: ESLint Plugin Query\n---\n\nTanStack Query comes with its own ESLint plugin. This plugin is used to enforce best practices and to help you avoid common mistakes.\n\n## Installation\n\nThe plugin is a separate package that you need to install:\n\n```bash\nnpm i -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\npnpm add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nyarn add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nbun add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query\n```\n\n## Flat Config (`eslint.config.js`)\n\n### Recommended setup\n\nTo enable all of the recommended rules for our plugin, add the following config:\n\n```js\nimport pluginQuery from '@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query'\n\nexport default [\n  ...pluginQuery.configs['flat/recommended'],\n  // Any other config...\n]\n```\n\n### Recommended strict setup\n\nThe `flat/recommended-strict` config extends `flat/recommended` with additional opinionated rules that enforce best practices more aggressively.\n\n```js\nimport pluginQuery from '@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query'\n\nexport default [\n  ...pluginQuery.configs['flat/recommended-strict'],\n  // Any other config...\n]\n```\n\n### Custom setup\n\nAlternatively, you can load the plugin and configure only the rules you want to use:\n\n```js\nimport pluginQuery from '@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query'\n\nexport default [\n  {\n    plugins: {\n      '@tanstack/query': pluginQuery,\n    },\n    rules: {\n      '@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps': 'error',\n    },\n  },\n  // Any other config...\n]\n```\n\n## Legacy Config (`.eslintrc`)\n\n### Recommended setup\n\nTo enable all of the recommended rules for our plugin, add `plugin:@tanstack/query/recommended` in extends:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"extends\": [\"plugin:@tanstack/query/recommended\"]\n}\n```\n\n### Recommended strict setup\n\nThe `recommendedStrict` config extends `recommended` with additional opinionated rules:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"extends\": [\"plugin:@tanstack/query/recommendedStrict\"]\n}\n```\n\n### Custom setup\n\nAlternatively, add `@tanstack/query` to the plugins section, and configure the rules you want to use:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plugins\": [\"@tanstack/query\"],\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps\": \"error\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Rules\n\n- [@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps](./exhaustive-deps.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/no-rest-destructuring](./no-rest-destructuring.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/stable-query-client](./stable-query-client.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/no-unstable-deps](./no-unstable-deps.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/infinite-query-property-order](./infinite-query-property-order.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/no-void-query-fn](./no-void-query-fn.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/mutation-property-order](./mutation-property-order.md)\n- [@tanstack/query/prefer-query-options](./prefer-query-options.md)\n"}
